ss runoff from earlier rainfall.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 146 PM AKDT, river gauge reports indicate rises in water\nlevels from heavy rain across the warned area. Flooding is\nongoing. Between 1.5 and 3 inches of rain have fallen.\nAdditional rainfall amounts up to 0.25 inches are possible.\n- For Yentna River at Lake Creek:\nAt 12:50pm the stage was 22.4 feet.\nFlood Stage is 20.5 feet.\nForecast: A crest around 22.4 feet is expected around 4:00pm\nWednesday.\n-The Yentna River at Lake Creek is forecast to go below flood\nstage Saturday morning August 8th.\n\nImpacts:\nBetween 21 and 22 feet, several lodges may have water in or\naround low-lying cabins.\n\n\n\n\n- Http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood","instruction":"Stay tuned to further developments by listening to your local radio,\ntelevision, or NOAA Weather Radio for further information.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["FLSAFC"],"WMOidentifier":["WGAK88 PAFC 052154"],"NWSheadline":["FLOOD WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL 1 PM AKDT FRIDAY"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.CON.PAFC.FA.W.0005.000000T0000Z-260807T2100Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-08-07T13:00:00-08:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["FLS"],"NationalWeatherService":["FAW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.5853c8de828d64a773a817026facd797a2832491.002.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-92.8,38.92],[-92.64,38.94],[-92.5,38.92],[-92.52,38.88],[-92.79,38.87],[-92.8,38.92]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.5853c8de828d64a773a817026facd797a2832491.002.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.5853c8de828d64a773a817026facd797a2832491.002.1","areaDesc":"Cooper, MO","geocode":{"SAME":["029053"],"UGC":["MOC053"]},"affectedZones":["https://api.weather.gov/zones/county/MOC053"],"references":[{"@id":